worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_08.js"
  ceiling 1319
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1264 to 1294 with the canonical operand order and entity-grounded hours mirror arms. Ceiling moved 1294 to 1311 for the calendar offset hook (calendar_reasoning: N days/weeks after/before a weekday). Ceiling moved 1311 to 1314 for the month-offset hook (calendar_reasoning: N months after/before a month or weekday). Ceiling moved 1314 to 1317 for the date-weekday hook (calendar_reasoning: the weekday a stated date falls on, R1017). Ceiling 1319 (2026-10-07, #1175 routing probes): a named weekday is a date signal for the calendar-create gate, twin of calendar_create.rs mentions_calendar_create_request."
